<p class="lp-direct-answer"><strong>CallTeam's shortlist:</strong> start with Bigin or Less Annoying CRM for a simple first setup, Pipedrive for active deal management, and HubSpot when enquiries and marketing need a shared record. Compare Zoho and Freshsales for more features on a tight budget. Close earns its place when calling is everyday work.</p><p class="lp-method"><strong>Prices and features checked {{ guide.reviewed }}.</strong> Official sources are linked in each review.</p></div></div>
